                                           '//!\n'
                                           '//! Higher-level topology mechanics publish [`CollisionStencil`] intent '
                                           'against\n'
                                           '//! immutable [`CollisionClipSource`] geometry. This domain owns the '
                                           'disposable\n'
                                           '//! Avian collider realization and rebuilds it only when effective '
                                           'topology changes.\n'
                                           "'''\n"
                                           '    return s.replace(old,new,1)\n'
